ALGONETWORK MARKETPLACE
Strategies are bought separately.

Your plan covers the platform. Strategies on AlgoNetwork are priced by the creators who built them — you buy the ones you want, once, and run them on your own account.

Creators set the price

Publish a strategy and name any price you want. There's no eligibility bar and no pay-to-list — your transparent backtest and forward-test record is what convinces buyers. You keep the bulk of every sale; Algorier takes a small platform fee.

Buyers pay once

Buy a strategy at the creator's price and it's yours to run — a one-time purchase, not a recurring fee. Your monthly plan only determines how many strategies you can run at the same time.

Logic stays private

Buyers get entry and exit signals and apply their own leverage, position size, and drawdown cap. The rules behind the signals are never exposed — so creators can sell an edge without giving it away.

